<title>SOUTH AFRICA: GOLF-SOUTH AFRICAN MASTERS THIRD ROUND SCORES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-SOUTH AFRICAN MASTERS THIRD ROUND SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>PORT EDWARD 1997-01-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading third round scores in</p>
<p>the 750,000 rand (160,000 dollar) South African Masters at San</p>
<p>Lameer Country Club near Port Edward on Saturday (South African</p>
<p>unless stated):</p>
<p>209 Mark McNulty (Zimbabwe) 71 68 70</p>
<p>210 Adilson da Silva (Brazil) 67 71 72</p>
<p>214 Deane Pappas 73 72 69</p>
<p>216 Bruce Vaughan (U.S.) 74 75 67, Sean Pappas 72 70 74,</p>
<p>Desvonde Botes 76 65 75</p>
<p>217 Mark Wiltshire 72 71 74</p>
<p>218 Chris Williams 76 72 70, Jeff Hawkes 72 73 73, Van</p>
<p>Phillips (England) 71 74 73, Graeme van der Nest 75 69 74</p>
